/mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0.139em; padding-top: 0.4em;\"><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right\" columnspacing=\"\" rowspacing=\"3pt\"><mtr><mtd><mtable rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.8em 0.5em\" columnspacing=\"0.278em\" displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr></mtable></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Then we apply the product rule, adding exponents in the product:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"16\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 4.346em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right;\"><mjx-mtable justify=\"right\" style=\"min-width: 4.346em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0.139em; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D462 TEX-